WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:03.600
Third Company, forward!

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:05.610
Dear Mother,

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:06.730
are you doing well?

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:12.950
Perhaps the climate has become milder and your body has recovered quite a bit?

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.580
As for me, since the time I wrote a month ago,

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.240
I have been positioned to a post away from the Federation frontline,

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:25.080
under Colonel Selvaria Bles, who leads the invasion of the Principality of Gallia.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:31.880
If I work hard here, maybe I'll be able to find the way to Central and to fame.

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:38.140
Chapter 9

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:38.140
Blue Witch

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:41.430
Repositioned from command of Lieutenant General Riedlich of the Central Force,

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.810
Lieutenant Carl Osawald reporting, ma'am!

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:48.360
I plan to put the best of my efforts under Colonel Selvaria Bles, ma'am!

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:50.230
Please look out for me, ma'am!

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:55.660
Understood, you may go now.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.530
O-Okay.

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:04.080
They say that it is a lot safer here than the frontline,

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.370
and the commanders are kind,

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:09.670
so please do not worry about anything, Mother.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:13.010
Maximilian is returning to the Empire?

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:15.340
What the heck is that supposed to be about?

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:20.300
It looks like there is going to be a war briefing held by His Majesty, the Emperor, himself.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:27.440
Oh well, I guess the higher-ups weren't too happy about the recent failures.

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:32.280
They want to show us that Central is keeping a constant eye on us.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:35.360
I'm not too fond of these political things.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:40.570
What do you think about me getting an aide from Central?

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:42.410
It's not just your division.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:47.040
There are ones sent to mine and to Selvaria's.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:48.620
Oh?

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:51.090
That is all.

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:56.050
While I am back in the homeland, I am leaving the command of this place in your hands.

00:01:56.470 --> 00:02:01.720
Does that mean I will not be able to stay by Your Majesty's side?

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.010
Nothing can be done.

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:05.220
It's what Central demands.

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:06.560
Central?

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:11.310
Central's bunch has told me to hurry back by myself.

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:15.690
They seemed to be fairly disdained by the occurring delays on the invasion of Gallia.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:20.200
They probably don't want to reduce the force on the front for my sake.

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.200
Will that be all, Your Majesty?

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:24.410
It is.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.330
Don't raise unnecessary suspicions.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:27.790
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:36.090
However, I have heard that the Gallian Invasion is all just a political struggle.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:41.010
As such, calling Your Majesty in for the petty reason of delays of the invasion...

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:43.550
Calm down, Selvaria.

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.810
I am saying that it is fine.

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:49.480
Excuse my insolence.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.310
You shall remain here.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:54.110
I will head to the capital.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:55.980
Understood.

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:02.570
Colonel.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.990
Have you been vested command during His Majesty's absence?

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:08.750
Please, order me at any time, ma'am.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.550
Is that the "Blue Witch"?

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:21.260
It seems like it will be hard to ingratiate her.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.930
But wait. Why is it "Blue"?

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:29.270
What are you sighing about?

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:34.310
Hey, hey. Don't let your misfire cause damage here as well.

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:36.070
I'm sorry.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:39.900
But you were the one who bursted...

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:44.200
You are... General Radi Jaeger!

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:45.910
Excuse me, sir!

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:49.250
You don't have to salute here.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:53.750
Let me be an ordinary man when I'm letting the water out at least.

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.090
But I haven't seen you before.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.340
Ah, I have yet to introduce myself.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:05.300
Positioned as a new aide to Colonel Selvaria, Lieutenant Carl Osawald reporting, sir!

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:06.970
Please, look after me, sir!

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:10.310
So you are the one sent from Central.

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.270
Yes, sir.

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.690
Is that so?

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:20.480
And thus, during the absence of His Majesty, Prince Maximilian, I will be taking command of the troops.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:22.610
Yeah, I've heard.

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:25.820
Gregor probably isn't too happy about it, but it shouldn't be a problem.

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:29.240
Maximilian trusts you very much.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:32.750
But I still cannot concur.

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:38.460
Should not at least one of us accompany His Majesty, the Prince?

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.050
I thought you would say that.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:43.130
It is true that it gets on me...

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:46.590
the demand from Central, that is.

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:48.800
Ah, right.

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.390
Could I ask you one thing?

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:55.770
At the time of your transfer, did Central's higher-ups tell you anything?

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:01.400
No, I was not told anything, sir.

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:05.950
Hmm? Really. I guess that's fine then.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:10.620
Anyhow, since you were put in charge, you should move as you think.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:14.620
That will be as His Majesty has willed.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.330
You never let that go, do you?

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.920
Before that though, that "majesty" isn't here.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.960
Think of how you want to take this.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:26.840
Arise, countrymen!

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:30.140
As of now, there is no one who can stop our justice!

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:32.310
Arise, countrymen!

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:37.600
Fight for the justice of his Majesty!

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:40.270
Deginuave!

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:43.190
Deginuave!

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:45.820
Deginuave!

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:53.540
Deginuave!

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.580
The masses can only be masses.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:00.710
Just be colloquial with words like "justice" and such,

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.380
and they joyfully take it in.

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:05.210
There is nothing to call them but fools.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:06.380
Don't say that.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:11.350
The people become our arm and leg that leads us to prosperity.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.930
Is it not, Your Majesty?

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:20.810
The time for you to take a move as the next emperor may have already arrived.

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:24.690
The masses will gratefully pledge allegiance to the Crown Prince.

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:28.700
Before that, I should take care not to be stabbed by those around me.

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:34.030
If the tide turns, opportunists like you will surely turn away as well.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.250
What do you ever mean?!

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:39.250
Our allegiance to you is steadfast.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.420
I'm just kidding.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:43.500
Forgive me.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:45.750
Anyhow,

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:49.840
if I am going to aim for the throne, there is one obstacle in the way.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.550
What would that be?

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.850
My brother who is of dirty blood.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:07:02.730
There are not many who shoulder him, but it can't be said that my strength is very solid either.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:06.860
Worry not, Your Majesty. The measures have already been taken.

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:10.950
Well, now. I have not heard of this.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:19.960
Is it clear?

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:24.250
Always be at Selvaria's side, and do not let her stay close to Maximilian.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.540
For what should...

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.130
You need not ask of more things.

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.380
Just do as you are told and it's good.

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:32.050
Yes, sir.

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:34.010
Do not worry.

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:37.470
If you get a result during the transfer period, I will call you back here...

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:39.890
with a fitting post.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.350
Yes, sir!

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.900
Colonel, where are you headed?

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.400
Colonel, to where?

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:01.160
You. Can you drive?

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:02.830
Yes, I can.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:03.670
Start it up.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:07.500
Even if you say so, where will you be heading?

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:09.460
It is not your business to know.

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:13.550
No, ma'am. I am your aide. I have a duty to know.

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:16.300
Going after His Majesty.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:17.810
That is what I will.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:21.180
Oh, is that what it is? His Majesty, the Prince...

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.770
Wait, that's not possible, ma'am!

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.690
Going after His Majesty, Prince Maximilian...

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:26.400
Fine. I shall go by myself.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.480
Please stop, ma'am!

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:31.780
You...

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.650
Do you mean to resist your superior?

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.160
No way, ma'am!

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:38.990
However, remaining here was what Prince Maximilian asked of you.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:42.580
I cannot let you betray His Majesty.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.850
I guess the word "betray" worked its way.

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:03.560
How submissive to Maximilian is this person?

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:19.700
Confirmed. It is Maximilian.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:25.080
Thanks for your hard work today.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.960
She should have given up for today with this.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:36.840
No, no. I should keep myself together to make sure she doesn't go after Maximilian.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.810
Ah, General Jaeger.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.230
Respect to efforts at this late time, sir!

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:49.940
Yeah. Kudos to you for the late-night patrol.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:00.780
Who is it?

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:02.700
It's me. I'm coming in.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:03.200
Go ahead, please.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.170
Are you alone?

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:09.330
Yes.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:10.830
Is something wrong?

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:15.260
Yeah. It is about those guys who were sent under us...

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:16.670
What about them?

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.840
There is something strange about them,

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.430
especially, that Carl fellow...

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:25.770
To me, he is nothing more than a nuisance.

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:27.480
I heard.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:30.980
You were trying to chase after Maximilian.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:35.230
You're filled with loyalty towards him as ever, eh?

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:37.610
What is it that you are trying to tell me?

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:44.620
Well, I was wondering. Besides you, why is that kid so tense when it comes to Maximilian?

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.660
So he is suspicious?

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:47.700
I do not know.

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:49.080
There is no evidence,

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:52.420
but just that does not make him clean.

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:56.840
If then, I will take his life at that time.

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:01.340
It's good that you get it.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:08.140
I guess it should be okay for tonight.

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:10.690
Who is it?

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.940
I'm sorry if I startled you, sir.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.650
I'm just a patrol.

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:18.610
No, it is I who should be sorry.

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.740
You are Lieutenant Carl Osawald, right, sir?

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:22.740
What is the matter this late at night?

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:26.540
Ah, yes. I could not find where my room was.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:31.040
I guess it couldn't be helped. You just arrived here.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:33.920
But you knew who I was.

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.590
Of course.

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:40.130
Everyone's been talking about you as the Elite Soldier sent from Central.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:42.090
Please, don't say that.

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:44.050
I am not as great as that.

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:48.310
Your room should be on the second floor of the quarters, sir.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:49.680
Thank you.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:51.480
I'll make sure to remember you.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:52.310
Okay.

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:00.570
What the hell is this?

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.700
Who is it?!

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:09.490
That's cruel. Have you already forgotten?

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:11.750
Y-You are...

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:14.830
This was the plan from the start.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:19.250
All you had to do was keep Selvaria grounded here.

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:22.550
You have fulfilled your duty.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.220
What...

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:28.220
Perhaps I'll leave a will for you.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:32.940
It isn't uncommon to see Elite Soldiers commit suicide after being demoted away from Central.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:39.020
A bad plan like that is boring.

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:51.290
C-Colonel!

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:53.460
Are you okay?

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:56.420
Kid, did you buy someone's anger?

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:58.380
No, of course not.

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.380
Right?

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:02.340
This assassin was probably sent from Central.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:07.390
It seems you were involved with a conspiracy from Central's higher-ups.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:17.270
Then... That means I have no place to return to?

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:22.400
No place to return to?

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.460
Do not worry.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:39.750
There is someone who is stretching out a hand.

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.220
So, what'll you do now?

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:48.800
We know that you aren't to blame.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:52.220
Since it's come to this, it's best if you spit it all out.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.350
Actually...

00:13:57.190 --> 00:14:05.990
I was sent with an order to keep the Colonel away from His Majesty while he was back at the Imperial capital.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.740
I see. That means...

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.370
Prince Maximilian!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:16.200
Mother, I think I've come to a totally absurd place.

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:25.880
Hey, what happened?

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.720
Let's go. Maximilian is close.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:43.520
From this road, it will take half a day to get there.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.860
The sunrise will be our deadline.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:48.150
Your Majesty...

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.160
What shall we do?

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:53.030
If anything happens to His Majesty...

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:55.700
We are going to keep that from happening!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.210
Your Majesty!

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:07.130
A sneak attack!

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.800
We are getting attacked from the southern side of the manor!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.050
So, have they come?

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:19.560
You've got some skill there.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:20.850
I have up made my mind, sir!

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:23.060
I will become the Colonel's strength!

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:25.610
I will make us arrive there in time!

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:37.700
Your Majesty!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:42.830
I'm surprised that Central would do something so gutsy as this.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.130
Charging in, ma'am!

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.010
Approved.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:50.470
Yes, ma'am!

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:02.100
Let's go. Maximilian is inside.

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:05.310
Reporting, sir.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:08.860
It seems the defense by the guards alone is difficult!

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:11.490
I shall defend Your Majesty, even as your shield!

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.280
Please escape immediately!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.370
Do not worry.

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:16.910
But...

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:22.620
It's in our sight.

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.000
The gate has been sealed!

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.290
Do not mind it. Keep going.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:35.800
Trust me.

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:36.970
Yes, ma'am!

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:49.730
They are here?

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:53.400
Maximilian, die!

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:54.990
I won't allow you!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:00.620
Your Majesty!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:04.920
Colonel!

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.580
Don't worry.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:07.630
But...

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.340
Take a good look.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.310
Awesome...

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:27.770
You probably thought it was strange that she was called the "Blue Witch."

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:32.570
Those who know her true form are few, even within the Imperial Military.

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:41.330
That is the true power of the Blue Witch, Selvaria the Valkyria.

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.410
Your Majesty!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:52.710
Were you all right?

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:07.060
I have no excuse for failing to follow the order to stay.

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.600
I will receive any punishment dearly.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.120
Is that all?

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:44.470
Raise your head, Maximilian.

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:51.230
Your recent records are not too great, it seems.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:54.770
However, with respect to your troops, during the military briefings,

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:59.400
it was decided that we will keep observing you for now.

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:06.410
But engrave in your heart that according to your future records, your troops may be subject to reduction.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:08.580
Understood.

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:24.550
It seems like you have gone through quite a bit of trouble.

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:29.390
Good grief. No one knows what is going to happen in the time of war.

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:30.890
Be alert.

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:34.360
You should not let your guard down as well.

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:43.490
Third Company, forward!

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.830
Dear Mother, how are you doing?

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:49.290
The beautiful season is approaching slowly.

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:54.290
As for me, I have become used to my new post.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:57.380
I have already written this in the last letter,

00:19:57.380 --> 00:20:01.380
but it's not as dangerous here, there's a lot of work,

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:03.220
and the superior is very nice.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:08.220
So, don't worry about me.

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:13.140
Hello. Oscar Bielert here.

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:18.190
I am Emile Bielert. On a side note, Oscar is the older brother, and I am the younger one.

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:21.310
Emile has a weak body, but he is working very hard.

00:20:21.310 --> 00:20:24.050
I don't want to be too much of a burden to you.

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.580
I will protect you.

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:27.880
And I will protect you as well.

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:31.020
Next, on Valkyria Chronicles:

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:33.660
